The other day I was playing, I had a kinda tough character - a Healer with an
ac of -6 and a handy spell of polymorph that I was using to make bad scrolls
into indentify scrolls. I had gotten down to around level 20, when suddenly
I got an error message:

	Suddenly, the dungeon collapses
	Error: makemon?  more-|

Needless to say, my character was paffed and the top ten list had that he
was "killed by a panic"
	This was Nethack 1.4. on the Macintosh

	Anyway, I assumed that I had gotten a virus or something and somehow
Nethack was able to detect that it was going to system error and kicked me
out itself. But then I checked my disks and found no identifiabl wrongness
with them.

